        "detailed_description": "<h1>BETTER TOGETHER!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/eb752af88487b79de59188f430767e81.avif?t=1782407794\" width=780 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s way more fun to jump in together and enjoy the chaos! Stay fishy, and we hope you all have fun on the open sea!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch Fish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different types of fishing rods to catch a wide variety of fish, or buy a spearfishing gun and test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/57fc56b24b616d04292cfe46834542ed.poster.avif?t=1782407794\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/57fc56b24b616d04292cfe46834542ed.webm?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/57fc56b24b616d04292cfe46834542ed.mp4?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep It Afloat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boat is your main safety. Repair damage, change fuses, fix the engine, and help each other stay alive. No one can swim, but there is a buoy you can use in case of emergency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/16e3e7045f8dab1aa675e9bc57293d57.poster.avif?t=1782407794\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/16e3e7045f8dab1aa675e9bc57293d57.webm?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/16e3e7045f8dab1aa675e9bc57293d57.mp4?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sea Exploration &amp; Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail across dark and unpredictable waters. Discover abandoned structures, strange locations, and unfamiliar locals. You never know what you’ll encounter out at sea. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/fe5fdbdd6de049ac6e484d9bc883ff31.poster.avif?t=1782407794\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/fe5fdbdd6de049ac6e484d9bc883ff31.webm?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/fe5fdbdd6de049ac6e484d9bc883ff31.mp4?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to survive, coordinate tasks, and rescue crewmates in danger or make questionable decisions that put everyone at risk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion is subjective. Customize your character with cosmetic and facial expression options, and unlock new hats through achievements while trying to survive each trip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/c7315dc6d14b706865534541b440b70b.poster.avif?t=1782407794\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/c7315dc6d14b706865534541b440b70b.webm?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/c7315dc6d14b706865534541b440b70b.mp4?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative multiplayer with proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple fishing rods and spearfishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boat that can flood, break, and sink</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange fish, monsters, and local inhabitants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration with dynamic events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades and progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent debt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drowning and environmental danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror-lite atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather that affects visibility and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frogs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch Fish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different types of fishing rods to catch a wide variety of fish, or buy a spearfishing gun and test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/57fc56b24b616d04292cfe46834542ed.poster.avif?t=1782407794\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/57fc56b24b616d04292cfe46834542ed.webm?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/57fc56b24b616d04292cfe46834542ed.mp4?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep It Afloat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boat is your main safety. Repair damage, change fuses, fix the engine, and help each other stay alive. No one can swim, but there is a buoy you can use in case of emergency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/16e3e7045f8dab1aa675e9bc57293d57.poster.avif?t=1782407794\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/16e3e7045f8dab1aa675e9bc57293d57.webm?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/16e3e7045f8dab1aa675e9bc57293d57.mp4?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sea Exploration &amp; Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail across dark and unpredictable waters. Discover abandoned structures, strange locations, and unfamiliar locals. You never know what you’ll encounter out at sea. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/fe5fdbdd6de049ac6e484d9bc883ff31.poster.avif?t=1782407794\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/fe5fdbdd6de049ac6e484d9bc883ff31.webm?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/fe5fdbdd6de049ac6e484d9bc883ff31.mp4?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to survive, coordinate tasks, and rescue crewmates in danger or make questionable decisions that put everyone at risk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion is subjective. Customize your character with cosmetic and facial expression options, and unlock new hats through achievements while trying to survive each trip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/c7315dc6d14b706865534541b440b70b.poster.avif?t=1782407794\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/c7315dc6d14b706865534541b440b70b.webm?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/c7315dc6d14b706865534541b440b70b.mp4?t=1782407794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative multiplayer with proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple fishing rods and spearfishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boat that can flood, break, and sink</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange fish, monsters, and local inhabitants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration with dynamic events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades and progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent debt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drowning and environmental danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror-lite atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather that affects visibility and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frogs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
